  "linkage_rules": [
    "Build and validate the existing fixed review payloads with the pinned Godot 4.7.1 materialization runner first.",
    "Resolve optional editorial-only overrides through the canonical D9.9 request/plan/bridge/adapter chain.",
    "Reject any selection, seed, variation or delivery/presentation-profile drift from the fixed base request.",
    "Bind the sidecar to the existing payload instance hash and the canonical request hash; explicitly retain both hashes if editorial values differ from the base fixture.",
    "Do not claim the fixed visual payload has consumed, rendered, or embedded sidecar values.",
    "Keep semantic region, geometry, visibility window, timebase, sample/interpolation, coordinate, audio/mux and renderer gates unresolved."
  ],
